  "$-\\sqrt{{@0}} = -{@1}$, to je záporné celé číslo.": "$-\\sqrt{{@0}} = -{@1}$, das ist eine negative ganze Zahl.",
  "$1\\,\\%$ je ${@0} : {@1} = {@2}$, celok ($100\\,\\%$) je ${@3}\\cdot 100 = {@4}$.": "$1\\,\\%$ ist ${@0} : {@1} = {@2}$, das Ganze ($100\\,\\%$) ist ${@3}\\cdot 100 = {@4}$.",
  "$S = 4\\pi r^2 \\approx 4\\cdot 3{,}14\\cdot {@0} = {@1}\\,\\text{cm}^2$.": "$S = 4\\pi r^2 \\approx 4\\cdot 3{,}14\\cdot {@0} = {@1}\\,\\text{cm}^2$.",
  "$S = a^2 + 4\\cdot\\frac{a\\cdot v_s}{2} = {@0} + 4\\cdot\\frac{{@1}\\cdot {@2}}{2} = {@3} + {@4} = {@5}\\,\\text{cm}^2$.": "$S = a^2 + 4\\cdot\\frac{a\\cdot v_s}{2} = {@0} + 4\\cdot\\frac{{@1}\\cdot {@2}}{2} = {@3} + {@4} = {@5}\\,\\text{cm}^2$.",
  "$V = \\frac{1}{3}\\pi r^2 v \\approx \\frac{1}{3}\\cdot 3{,}14\\cdot {@0}\\cdot {@1} = 3{,}14\\cdot {@2} = {@3}\\,\\text{cm}^3$.": "$V = \\frac{1}{3}\\pi r^2 v \\approx \\frac{1}{3}\\cdot 3{,}14\\cdot {@0}\\cdot {@1} = 3{,}14\\cdot {@2} = {@3}\\,\\text{cm}^3$.",
  "$V = \\frac{1}{3}a^2 v = \\frac{1}{3}\\cdot {@0}\\cdot {@1} = {@2}\\,\\text{cm}^3$.": "$V = \\frac{1}{3}a^2 v = \\frac{1}{3}\\cdot {@0}\\cdot {@1} = {@2}\\,\\text{cm}^3$.",
  "$V = \\frac{4}{3}\\pi r^3 \\approx \\frac{4}{3}\\cdot 3{,}14\\cdot {@0} = 3{,}14\\cdot {@1} = {@2}\\,\\text{cm}^3$.": "$V = \\frac{4}{3}\\pi r^3 \\approx \\frac{4}{3}\\cdot 3{,}14\\cdot {@0} = 3{,}14\\cdot {@1} = {@2}\\,\\text{cm}^3$.",
  "$\\frac{{@0}}{3} = {@1}$, to je prirodzené číslo.": "$\\frac{{@0}}{3} = {@1}$, das ist eine natürliche Zahl.",
  "$\\sqrt{{@0}} = {@1}$, to je prirodzené číslo.": "$\\sqrt{{@0}} = {@1}$, das ist eine natürliche Zahl.",
  "$\\sqrt{{@0}}$ je iracionálne a pripočítaním 1 sa to nezmení.": "$\\sqrt{{@0}}$ ist irrational, und durch Addieren von 1 ändert sich das nicht.",
  "$a^2 - b^2$ sa nerovná $(a - b)^2$. Použi vzorec $a^2 - b^2 = (a + b)(a - b)$.": "$a^2 - b^2$ ist nicht gleich $(a - b)^2$. Verwende die Formel $a^2 - b^2 = (a + b)(a - b)$.",
  "$c = \\frac{{@0}}{100}\\cdot {@1} = {@2}$.": "$c = \\frac{{@0}}{100}\\cdot {@1} = {@2}$.",
  "$c^2 = {@0}^2 + {@1}^2 = {@2} + {@3} = {@4}$, teda $c = {@5}\\,\\text{m}$.": "$c^2 = {@0}^2 + {@1}^2 = {@2} + {@3} = {@4}$, also $c = {@5}\\,\\text{m}$.",
  "$f({@0}) = {@1}{@2}{@3} = {@4}{@5} = {@6}$.": "$f({@0}) = {@1}{@2}{@3} = {@4}{@5} = {@6}$.",
  "$k = \\frac{a'}{a} = \\frac{{@0}}{{@1}} = {@2}$, teda ${@3} = {@4}\\cdot {@5} = {@6}\\,\\text{cm}$.": "$k = \\frac{a'}{a} = \\frac{{@0}}{{@1}} = {@2}$, also ${@3} = {@4}\\cdot {@5} = {@6}\\,\\text{cm}$.",
  "$k = \\frac{a'}{a} = \\frac{{@0}}{{@1}} = {@2}$. {@3}": "$k = \\frac{a'}{a} = \\frac{{@0}}{{@1}} = {@2}$. {@3}",
  "$k = \\frac{{@0} - {@1}}{{@2} - {@3}} = \\frac{{@4}}{{@5}} = {@6}$. Dosadíme bod $A$: ${@7} = {@8}{@9} + q$, teda $q = {@10}$.": "$k = \\frac{{@0} - {@1}}{{@2} - {@3}} = \\frac{{@4}}{{@5}} = {@6}$. Wir setzen den Punkt $A$ ein: ${@7} = {@8}{@9} + q$, also $q = {@10}$.",
  "$k$ je zmena $y$ delená zmenou $x$. Potom dosaď jeden bod do $y = kx + q$ a vypočítaj $q$.": "$k$ ist die Änderung von $y$ geteilt durch die Änderung von $x$. Dann setze einen Punkt in $y = kx + q$ ein und berechne $q$.",
  "$p = \\frac{{@0}}{{@1}}\\cdot 100 = {@2}\\,\\%$.": "$p = \\frac{{@0}}{{@1}}\\cdot 100 = {@2}\\,\\%$.",
  "$u^2 = {@0}^2 + {@1}^2 + {@2}^2 = {@3} + {@4} + {@5} = {@6}$, teda $u = {@7}\\,\\text{cm}$.": "$u^2 = {@0}^2 + {@1}^2 + {@2}^2 = {@3} + {@4} + {@5} = {@6}$, also $u = {@7}\\,\\text{cm}$.",
  "$x$ je {@0} a $y$ je {@1}, preto bod leží v časti {@2}.": "$x$ ist {@0} und $y$ ist {@1}, deshalb liegt der Punkt im Bereich: {@2}.",
  "$x_S = \\frac{{@0} + {@1}}{2} = {@2}$, $y_S = \\frac{{@3} + {@4}}{2} = {@5}$, teda ${@6}$.": "$x_S = \\frac{{@0} + {@1}}{2} = {@2}$, $y_S = \\frac{{@3} + {@4}}{2} = {@5}$, also ${@6}$.",
  "${@0} = ({@1})^2 - {@2}^2$, je to rozdiel štvorcov: $a^2 - b^2 = (a + b)(a - b)$, teda ${@3}$.": "${@0} = ({@1})^2 - {@2}^2$, das ist eine Differenz von Quadraten: $a^2 - b^2 = (a + b)(a - b)$, also ${@3}$.",
  "${@0} = {@1}^2$ a ${@2}x = 2\\cdot x\\cdot {@3}$, takže ide o vzorec $(a {@4} b)^2 = a^2 {@5} 2ab + b^2$: ${@6} = {@7}$.": "${@0} = {@1}^2$ und ${@2}x = 2\\cdot x\\cdot {@3}$, es handelt sich also um die Formel $(a {@4} b)^2 = a^2 {@5} 2ab + b^2$: ${@6} = {@7}$.",
  "${@0}$-krát dlhšie": "${@0}$-mal so lang",
  "${@0}\\,\\%$ z neznámeho čísla je {@1}. Aké je to číslo?": "${@0}\\,\\%$ einer unbekannten Zahl sind {@1}. Wie heißt die Zahl?",
  "${@0}\\cdot {@1} + {@2}\\cdot {@3} = {@4}\\cdot({@5} + {@6}) = {@7}\\cdot 100 = {@8}$.": "${@0}\\cdot {@1} + {@2}\\cdot {@3} = {@4}\\cdot({@5} + {@6}) = {@7}\\cdot 100 = {@8}$.",
  "${@0}\\cdot {@1} = {@2}\\,\\text{cm}$. Keďže $1\\,\\text{km} = 100\\,000\\,\\text{cm}$, je to ${@3}\\,\\text{km}$.": "${@0}\\cdot {@1} = {@2}\\,\\text{cm}$. Da $1\\,\\text{km} = 100\\,000\\,\\text{cm}$, sind das ${@3}\\,\\text{km}$.",
  "${@0}^2 + {@1}^2 = {@2}$ a ${@3}^2 = {@4}$. {@5}": "${@0}^2 + {@1}^2 = {@2}$ und ${@3}^2 = {@4}$. {@5}",
  "${@0}^2 - {@1}^2 = ({@2} + {@3})({@4} - {@5}) = {@6}\\cdot {@7} = {@8}$.": "${@0}^2 - {@1}^2 = ({@2} + {@3})({@4} - {@5}) = {@6}\\cdot {@7} = {@8}$.",
  "$|AB|^2 = ({@0} - {@1})^2 + ({@2} - {@3})^2 = {@4}^2 + {@5}^2 = {@6} + {@7} = {@8}$, teda $|AB| = {@9}$.": "$|AB|^2 = ({@0} - {@1})^2 + ({@2} - {@3})^2 = {@4}^2 + {@5}^2 = {@6} + {@7} = {@8}$, also $|AB| = {@9}$.",
