  "h = {@0} · <span class=\"c-accent\">T<sub>n</sub> = {@1}</span> · presne I = {@2} · chyba {@3}": "h = {@0} · <span class=\"c-accent\">T<sub>n</sub> = {@1}</span> · exakt I = {@2} · Fehler {@3}",
